Sat Oct 17 17:15:24 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 2.5.1 (changes since 2.4.0):
  * New Hinawa.FwReqError enumeration for the error domain,
    previously the FwRcode enumeration was misused for it
  * Documentation framework switched from gtk-doc to gi-docgen;
    API docs are not built (-Ddoc=false, the upstream default)
    because gi-docgen fails on this release's stale annotations
  * Test-script refinements and missing inclusion guards
- Soname unchanged (libhinawa.so.2)
- Add pkgconfig(gobject-2.0) >= 2.44.0 floor from src/meson.build
- Spec cleanup via spec-cleaner

-------------------------------------------------------------------
